{"ID":"20240314091929-q8ycvh4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091929-q8ycvh4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091929-q8ycvh4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164605-7lf6uqn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164605-8m8trj2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164605-8m8trj2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:89,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:89\u0026#125;","title":"【茵陈五苓散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422164605"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422164605-7lf6uqn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422164605-7lf6uqn","updated":"20240422164605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄疸病，茵陈五苓散主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164605-sabrsxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164605-sabrsxy","updated":"20240422164605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茵陈五苓散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164605-ii0sjht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164605-ii0sjht","updated":"20240422164605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茵陈蒿十分末，五苓散五分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164605-gqjt3wo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164605-gqjt3wo","updated":"20240422164605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味，各先食饮服方寸匕，日三服"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164605-tbr9gbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164605-tbr9gbd","updated":"20240422164605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个茵陈五苓散呢，用的非常的多，茵陈五苓散和茵陈篙汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茵陈篙汤是大便便秘，身黄，茵陈五苓散小便排不出来，身黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164605-yj9pnek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164605-yj9pnek","updated":"20240422164605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是茵陈篙和五苓散混合就是茵陈五苓散。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先食，就是饭前吃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，药粉剂。这个黄疸病也是全身发黄，小便没有，那五苓散的主症就是病人口渴，小便不利，对不对？兼带发黄的时候，就是用茵陈五苓散。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164605-8m8trj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164605-8m8trj2","updated":"20240422164605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床看的时候，有些人是急性肝炎，有些人是胆阻塞，或者是其他样，anyway，你只要看到这个症状，你都可以使用它，所以我们同样是同样一个黄，一个是大便便秘，一个是小便不利，就两个。"}]}]}